{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#958","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#958","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#958\",\"parent_revision\":\"3322147e6839fcd4ea221ce9512d51a5c2368832b8a984e1273144577c0a6aa1\",\"root_revision\":\"3322147e6839fcd4ea221ce9512d51a5c2368832b8a984e1273144577c0a6aa1\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nMigrate SAM hook scripts from python3-development to development-harness.\\n\\nThe hook scripts that the entire SAM workflow depends on exist ONLY in python3-development:\\n- `plugins/python3-development/skills/implementation-manager/scripts/task_status_hook.py`\\n- `plugins/python3-development/skills/implementation-manager/scripts/task_format.py`\\n- `plugins/python3-development/skills/implementation-manager/scripts/get_task_context.py`\\n\\nThe dh `implementation-manager/scripts/` directory has only stale `.pyc` cache files with no source.\\n\\nThese scripts are language-agnostic (they parse YAML frontmatter and update timestamps). They must move to dh so that `start-task` and `implement-feature` hook paths resolve correctly after migration.\\n\\nAfter moving, update all hook path references in skill frontmatter that point to the old python3-development location.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **maintainer of the codebase**, I want to **migrate sam hook scripts (task_status_hook.py, task_format.py) from python3-development to development-harness** so that **the code is cleaner and more maintainable**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Session 2026-03-21: skill-migration-comparison report (.claude/reports/skill-migration-comparison-20